# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile. Tests, fixtures and local artefacts never enter the image (O2 condition 3b).
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts
**/__fixtures__
apps/web/e2e
tooling
docs
deploy/.env
deploy/*.env
